# Copy this file to .env.secrets and fill in real values.
# .env.secrets is gitignored and overrides configs/qbittorrent_exporter/.env.
# qBittorrent's username/password are not here: they are shared with
# qbittorrent and homepage, so they live in configs/qbittorrent/secrets/ and
# are delivered via compose `secrets:` (FILE__QBITTORRENT_USER/PASS). See
# docs/COMPOSE_CONVENTIONS.md.
